 "library": {
  "title": "Rustic porch",
  "description": "Rustic porch: an entrance porch for the front door of a house \u2014 rough timber posts and beams on a log or stone base, plank floor. Overall about 4.1 x 2.9 x 3.3 m (width x depth x height). Stands on z = 0; place it against a facade with the door behind it. One of five porch styles (classical, craftsman, Victorian, rustic, modern) designed together.",
